  "updated_at": "2026-03-09",
  "bio": "Chandler Bass is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Moncks Corner, United States, specializing in traditional and dotwork styles. Renowned for their professionalism, Chandler maintains a strict standard of cleanliness, ensuring every client's experience is not only comfortable but also held to the highest hygiene standards. Those looking to work with Chandler can find them at Black Sparrow from Thursday to Monday between 11am and 9pm, with a $100 deposit required for appointments.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Moncks Corner, South Carolina, United States"
}